<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name>Marvel Atlas Project</name>
    <description><![CDATA[An ongoing initiative to map significant Marvel Comics — [click for details]<br><br>Map icons differentiate between locations with strong support from the comics (✔︎) and those with vague or contradictory clues that involve more guesswork (?). Fictional islands and countries have been given secondary indicators that approximate their land boundaries.<br><br>Feedback is welcome! If you see any errors or omissions, drop me a line at agent.of.atlas@icloud.com (Please note that this map reflects the COMIC BOOKS — not the movies).<br><br>Forever indebted to Sean Kleefeld for starting this project so long ago and passing the torch along to me.]]></description>
