      <Placemark>
        <name>Atlantis</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7AQGgOqpZlXUYTjta6gdOqcU33CEzU9lbjtYH_DelY7ie43EAq1Mrm8upmkaUs8nRIFTpSN1GZFSTtcHiCJ1vI8dTqcf-X5ZekCgxrDx17h9NzglNFEGxeY6AJCnslHbjEm06O1ewrhPT97me3OrGej5NHQACSDN2ODk435bApn69izPZGhwZcxOK0ylVhtEB3G0U?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: Capitol city of the Atlantean people.<br>Notes: While Atlanteans live throughout the oceans, the location of their capitol city moves from location to location due to it being a frequent target by various enemies from above and below the sea. The most recent confirmed location as of this writing — Squadron Supreme #13 — describes it being just off the Western Saharan coast. This location puts it just a bit further beyond the Canary Islands.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>Capitol city of the Atlantean people.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value>While Atlanteans live throughout the oceans, the location of their capitol city moves from location to location due to it being a frequent target by various enemies from above and below the sea. The most recent confirmed location as of this writing — Squadron Supreme #13 — describes it being just off the Western Saharan coast. This location puts it just a bit further beyond the Canary Islands.</value>
          </Data>
