      <Placemark>
        <name>Bar With No Name Massacre</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7uJ5k-KuJ11sC-iIG3_wJQQjV4D4sSUlHdt5WzTFuOD_cXV0UqFDQSPfDBL09ZstbNvlHnUbUWt0n-mZKlfGTQWhYgMCzoYnG_YzXHuIkQPs2L1fpxqneHa7ulQADdPqU7GHSou-AtjCimrS2O1nG93wS-t6dzsMu8pCLwi2lD5XCet_0168KirFB1D45LhjC1tzw?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: The remote midwestern (not-so-) safehouse in which 18 supervillains were murdered by the Scourge of the Underworld.<br>Notes: In Captain America #320, we learn that the location is somewhere in Medina country, 40 miles from a waterfront warehouse area on the edge of Lake Erie (presumably Cleveland). This placemark takes advantage of a lonely abandoned  building (viewable on Satellite View).]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>The remote midwestern (not-so-) safehouse in which 18 supervillains were murdered by the Scourge of the Underworld.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value>In Captain America #320, we learn that the location is somewhere in Medina country, 40 miles from a waterfront warehouse area on the edge of Lake Erie (presumably Cleveland). This placemark takes advantage of a lonely abandoned  building (viewable on Satellite View).</value>
