            <value>Nazi-held island from which Captain America and Bucky were believed KIA after disabling an explosive drone plane</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value><![CDATA[Ed Brubaker's Captain America (2004) #6 clarified decades of inconsistent locations by establishing this event happened on an "uncharted" Channel Island. Beyond that, this placemark is meant to be a bit out of the way of shipping lanes.]]></value>
