      <Placemark>
        <name><![CDATA[Baron Zemo's Hidden Fortress]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6q-FE7df9V-8HuVBVsf2Tyrs8jmPjR59uOpHJxvwfR9qkbBU3xdIyZEctelG5NhKPNbD5_lnfJiC1BIhSu5sKwj4o2gAEgGfFFNy2tvX2O48q5zgsc1gd1z1U3UyZJFiiWYheCfstwV5U6rTqqb1wBsqv68f4-piEQb-ua5KakdttaD8iVthvPR9VOa3HMETm9qZQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: Heavily fortified castle where Heinrich Zemo died in his showdown with Captain America. Used as a base by the Masters of Evil and was the site where Wonder Man and Eric Josten got their powers.<br>Notes: Early Avengers issues referred to this location as being deep in the Amazon jungle in an almost inaccessible canyon, shown near a river, and below a rocky cliffside. Much later, Avengers: Earth’s Mightiest Heroes #6 identified it as being in Bolivia. The Bala Gorge is an excellent candidate which fits all this criteria.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>Heavily fortified castle where Heinrich Zemo died in his showdown with Captain America. Used as a base by the Masters of Evil and was the site where Wonder Man and Eric Josten got their powers.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value>Early Avengers issues referred to this location as being deep in the Amazon jungle in an almost inaccessible canyon, shown near a river, and below a rocky cliffside. Much later, Avengers: Earth’s Mightiest Heroes #6 identified it as being in Bolivia. The Bala Gorge is an excellent candidate which fits all this criteria.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6q-FE7df9V-8HuVBVsf2Tyrs8jmPjR59uOpHJxvwfR9qkbBU3xdIyZEctelG5NhKPNbD5_lnfJiC1BIhSu5sKwj4o2gAEgGfFFNy2tvX2O48q5zgsc1gd1z1U3UyZJFiiWYheCfstwV5U6rTqqb1wBsqv68f4-piEQb-ua5KakdttaD8iVthvPR9VOa3HMETm9qZQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
