      <Placemark>
        <name>Braddock Academy</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR74oxbJxM0ZnZwi607Yrtn1ZzZWpWFO0o8-rSnnhxHLLTQVeY-ngkDMY-5CFn8nAd_LySrjQBejnv7qg6Z-P6Pn6WxIM5O0eM6omswRStCjt-eGdQ_shF9c1XJCnxGLrIRB70F5MEYquFI0PIPJP-t37T9kXEBlMC6WCLvCFxtNLUNeSBZE7cfhluOZxNHtzdyZIww?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: The birthplace and home of Captain Britain and Psylocke, which has since been converted into a school to train UK superheroes.<br>Notes: The Official Handbook of the Marvel Universe: X-Men 2005 indicates that Captain Britain was born at Braddock Manor in Maldon, England. This placemark is positioned to reflect the portrayals of the manor which consistently depict a countryside landscape.]]></description>
