      <Placemark>
        <name>Braddock Lighthouse</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR4pzMUxmei1X06sMc3037tu3O4qyMBiBRZ79a8SD9mvHktATxhxUhDOLetT-HHHOH5Ejm5_G6EeP_Pa5MJ1zzupaVwwfvEj4TCIAfk1LVL9K7li-z3Zzphe3qQ77QqCvOV4dT6ZpCRptdm3rJza0IzAbBCUXKweIAtZCQhh317Y7rW78yr6gNp3wRC44VcPDPPcyNQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: Brian Braddock's lighthouse home which serves as base for Excalibur.<br>Notes: Although recent comics — Excalibur (2019) #2 — places this in Cornwall, there is an abundance of prior instances placing the lighthouse on the west coast of England on the Celtic Sea. The most exacting of these is Excalibur #49 (1992) by Alan Davis actually pinpoints this location on a map of the UK.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value><![CDATA[Brian Braddock's lighthouse home which serves as base for Excalibur.]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value>Although recent comics — Excalibur (2019) #2 — places this in Cornwall, there is an abundance of prior instances placing the lighthouse on the west coast of England on the Celtic Sea. The most exacting of these is Excalibur #49 (1992) by Alan Davis actually pinpoints this location on a map of the UK.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR4pzMUxmei1X06sMc3037tu3O4qyMBiBRZ79a8SD9mvHktATxhxUhDOLetT-HHHOH5Ejm5_G6EeP_Pa5MJ1zzupaVwwfvEj4TCIAfk1LVL9K7li-z3Zzphe3qQ77QqCvOV4dT6ZpCRptdm3rJza0IzAbBCUXKweIAtZCQhh317Y7rW78yr6gNp3wRC44VcPDPPcyNQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
