      <Placemark>
        <name><![CDATA[Captain Marvel's Base]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6uxq7rbhUfrBVKhwKqAqVw6RJpKZGEu0GZlw6nhpcM6shndTsgEKvssTAvF-S6NwCljQIdig8Gubwuk_geJJnZx0TSwdfeXNAJRwGorYSadtenumvI6JMvyRaZZR8xFdU0NpDMpjW1gUY-KqcEbojHa2xrATFIyI5ws48sNPuiX2ZcZmhtxQSVXc822BhMOghOxBM?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: Captain Marvel's underwater base off the pier of her family's summer home.<br>Notes: Captain Marvel (2019) #9 set Carol’s secret base off the pier of the Danvers summer home — which the Life of Captain Marvel miniseries placed the Danvers summer home in the Harpswell Sound area. The exact location is a little vague with the view across the sound changing from issue to issue, but this location selects a house off a road that runs parallel to the shoreline as portrayed in Life of Captain Marvel #1]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value><![CDATA[Captain Marvel's underwater base off the pier of her family's summer home.]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value>Captain Marvel (2019) #9 set Carol’s secret base off the pier of the Danvers summer home — which the Life of Captain Marvel miniseries placed the Danvers summer home in the Harpswell Sound area. The exact location is a little vague with the view across the sound changing from issue to issue, but this location selects a house off a road that runs parallel to the shoreline as portrayed in Life of Captain Marvel #1</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6uxq7rbhUfrBVKhwKqAqVw6RJpKZGEu0GZlw6nhpcM6shndTsgEKvssTAvF-S6NwCljQIdig8Gubwuk_geJJnZx0TSwdfeXNAJRwGorYSadtenumvI6JMvyRaZZR8xFdU0NpDMpjW1gUY-KqcEbojHa2xrATFIyI5ws48sNPuiX2ZcZmhtxQSVXc822BhMOghOxBM?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            -69.965558,43.7856089,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
