      <Placemark>
        <name><![CDATA[Cooterman's Creek]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7hX-dER6Z8IYrwFY5Oaxr0yCojbXz7UXKn78qfrY0F3diy9t-ncWbH3oxgWaHI5tY7jwtEI8rTmeOgSamZBrWBxs2d662eTyCkhXyfBMylfCp_ZTddTwzlbnAEdaKzkNzz2X6A5NSrvvBYEyIeqv3pRMkQEPKrLFB4GyerVmg9OwrhJHqo1tMue53QQ-yhQFPbtRs?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: An abandoned mining town adopted as a base of operations for the Reavers, and then by the X-Men for a period<br>Notes: Though Uncanny X-Force #5.1 marked the Reaver's old base as being in North Central Australia, the most specific account comes from X-Men v2 #44, specifying its about 200 miles southeast of Lake Disappointment in the Gibson Desert. Given that there are rusty old automobiles shown at this place, its reasonable to place it along a road, and in this case, Gunbarrel Highway intersects across a semi-dry creek bed almost exactly 200 miles southeast from Lake Disappointment.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>An abandoned mining town adopted as a base of operations for the Reavers, and then by the X-Men for a period</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value><![CDATA[Though Uncanny X-Force #5.1 marked the Reaver's old base as being in North Central Australia, the most specific account comes from X-Men v2 #44, specifying its about 200 miles southeast of Lake Disappointment in the Gibson Desert. Given that there are rusty old automobiles shown at this place, its reasonable to place it along a road, and in this case, Gunbarrel Highway intersects across a semi-dry creek bed almost exactly 200 miles southeast from Lake Disappointment.]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7hX-dER6Z8IYrwFY5Oaxr0yCojbXz7UXKn78qfrY0F3diy9t-ncWbH3oxgWaHI5tY7jwtEI8rTmeOgSamZBrWBxs2d662eTyCkhXyfBMylfCp_ZTddTwzlbnAEdaKzkNzz2X6A5NSrvvBYEyIeqv3pRMkQEPKrLFB4GyerVmg9OwrhJHqo1tMue53QQ-yhQFPbtRs?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            125.6904307,-25.6971835,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
