      <Placemark>
        <name>Daily Bugle</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR5JNiuoshQDUXw69WQOQ1xw_9C8tOiAwn75tzM5rQSjLz2FDAwggfcCHcESIJu-BzQ0XfvJxcWI-6TZwAGno8hLZRMDQI1rDEYa70W0nFKrHYrqKxV1cvKWLtRn0WWIi7eZKGSn_Cbe31KVbv-HPaQer0JeNLnJUtBIEqMjugfYX-bXr-1f_z0k12ZdOjx35qJo5Ik?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: After the demolition of their longtime building, the relaunched Daily Bugle set up shop in the ground floor of an office building.<br>Notes: Apart from general references to being in Midtown, the best indication to date is a mention that the Flatiron Building is equidistant between the Daily Bugle, the Holland Tunnel, and a SoHo spa. That would suggest the Bugle is in this general vicinity.]]></description>
