      <Placemark>
        <name><![CDATA[Doctor Doom's Monastery]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR4VpmkHQtbTTCCSujiFKIQaJRbCLTtB2bXcOUhalznxknBECRqcNIZJWYcG5dn2pmo6cPAK8nMJ9KJ2vwM5h0An2Vo3ds8bgvsDJTo5vPyp2Abo_5UCbEzQ5DjstGQvMNV7g2Tgs-iN0Cd0cfHbo-adQD1LcULYcq4BFo0RAPtYeoE8gVOxl8m_H6_nOePiNYMBEug?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: The temple dwelling of the monks that assisted Doctor Doom with his original armor.<br>Notes: Brubaker’s Books of Doom series featured Doom coming down from the mountain to a village with children asking for Rupees, currency of Nepal, India, and Pakistan; helping to narrow down the possible remote Himalayan mountain position of this location.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>The temple dwelling of the monks that assisted Doctor Doom with his original armor.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value>Brubaker’s Books of Doom series featured Doom coming down from the mountain to a village with children asking for Rupees, currency of Nepal, India, and Pakistan; helping to narrow down the possible remote Himalayan mountain position of this location.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
