        <name>The Site Gwen Stacy Died</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR5chBbziWTEVyGo6gtwNrhuJjI3XVCs4pd_Ro0MiuO__SdsUK-OJ3pzhZnLUil84AcrFs7sv4PDdPkuyphIPW57DseOakVKFnj4jJzXvQELWl_RiC2bc64-ECZCnrCUVj2iDfaA1ItLkUAt9pL_zgXbR64ghe4hfjOFe2JZiAEBD0VBQ5CYYXuZBrxI5zCkQppOYNU?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: Site where Gwen Stacy was pushed off the Brooklyn Bridge.<br>Notes: Regarding the famous discrepancy as to whether this happened at the Brooklyn Bridge or the George Washington Bridge: I attribute the mixup to unreliable narrator — Spidey was the one who said "George Washington," and he was a the time a bit addled from his cold and having his girlfriend kidnapped.]]></description>
