      <Placemark>
        <name>Hawkeye Investigations / West Coast Avengers</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR5LZLkeTMLcSnqdENW2VpYOB6ELgZ6i6OWK68kJzpf70YZl-_fOyyU9_tLdgPHlNCzN4K7OKq8TC2WEumM_f-EcXIS851HhxoI9WqgJ2av25EnEWjSXSa0d5oJ9xoifQW_ChNL4wdHIQlD8q5M1etFZhlqXjXort2UEajm2aXkSpNKmraSWxIXMloODyb-sm-1MtSE?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: The Venice Beach location where Kate Bishop set up shop and then got turned into a new West Coast Avengers HQ.<br>Notes: Even though the recap page from Hawkeye #1 places Kate's place on Venice, it's clear from the distinctive shop across the street with the arches and corinthian columns, that she's on Windward Avenue (which, with the Venice Sign on it on one end, really does *feel* like it should be called Venice Blvd). ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1769-FF5252-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>The Venice Beach location where Kate Bishop set up shop and then got turned into a new West Coast Avengers HQ.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value><![CDATA[Even though the recap page from Hawkeye #1 places Kate's place on Venice, it's clear from the distinctive shop across the street with the arches and corinthian columns, that she's on Windward Avenue (which, with the Venice Sign on it on one end, really does *feel* like it should be called Venice Blvd). ]]></value>
          </Data>
