      <Placemark>
        <name>Hellfire Club</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6SRsRzDga2aP1S4ujYjb7hwxOZZoWwB99-nC4vyOWVXLVjoYFtQvmYkcqTJVK-vWiqtf4s41k5-VstXh0PkofWW_jeRr4z61hArL3k4nyEGvHUxm9nXmyZ43Pb2gJq4g9iRdL-y_jO_V03ADepuNz-1kHJkh7mUGA42ZyN0A_b1lgnJkaxnuLIi9rcWFmKrsHHN-4?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: Exclusive club for the elite with decadent appetites. The secret Inner Circle is a cabal of mutants seeking financial and political power. <br>Notes: Although the maps in the Official Handbooks place this on 3rd Avenue, several of Claremont's descriptions from the comics decades apart specify 5th Avenue (a few blocks down from the Avengers Mansion). Yet another alternate address from Young X-Men places it at 69th and Lexington.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>Exclusive club for the elite with decadent appetites. The secret Inner Circle is a cabal of mutants seeking financial and political power. </value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value><![CDATA[Although the maps in the Official Handbooks place this on 3rd Avenue, several of Claremont's descriptions from the comics decades apart specify 5th Avenue (a few blocks down from the Avengers Mansion). Yet another alternate address from Young X-Men places it at 69th and Lexington.]]></value>
          </Data>
