      <Placemark>
        <name>Hillrock Heights</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6ivG4TGJ0WUwt3hrxPqdhRRNoMCBAEVXuVROngwzIcKeiciCtk1dHQb6gmviapvGmGABEU-42SU-SImtrNG9TLc7NBENJjKytimC2neX-5ewXDmTJ5x72ngNB-6c6SuXOkYRT85QByy1eg_VDpXepiqbNQephGO2X0D2t2rQKoID9awLxgBncHyO4k4_wNtzw_OeQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: Ghost Rider / Robbie Reyes' neighborhood, home to his residence, Canelo's Auto & Body, Patrick Wellman Developmental Center, and Lincoln High School<br>Notes: Felipe Smith's Ghost Rider series specified Hillrock Heights is a neighborhood in East Los Angeles and is accessible from the 5 (Ghost Rider #5). Though the street names from the comic are all fictional, this neighborhood of East Los Angeles, bound by highways on three sides, is currently one of the few East LA neighborhoods without a moniker — and does have at least one hilly area.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value><![CDATA[Ghost Rider / Robbie Reyes' neighborhood, home to his residence, Canelo's Auto & Body, Patrick Wellman Developmental Center, and Lincoln High School]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value><![CDATA[Felipe Smith's Ghost Rider series specified Hillrock Heights is a neighborhood in East Los Angeles and is accessible from the 5 (Ghost Rider #5). Though the street names from the comic are all fictional, this neighborhood of East Los Angeles, bound by highways on three sides, is currently one of the few East LA neighborhoods without a moniker — and does have at least one hilly area.]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6ivG4TGJ0WUwt3hrxPqdhRRNoMCBAEVXuVROngwzIcKeiciCtk1dHQb6gmviapvGmGABEU-42SU-SImtrNG9TLc7NBENJjKytimC2neX-5ewXDmTJ5x72ngNB-6c6SuXOkYRT85QByy1eg_VDpXepiqbNQephGO2X0D2t2rQKoID9awLxgBncHyO4k4_wNtzw_OeQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
