      <Placemark>
        <name>Hotel Inferno</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR5-ZnSlXyg0yEKSBSy8yrM7gNeoKtvYNDyCqgjiMBCh2oeouh6soYkWMd5B-l3CdnviehTnAKAmSiwsu66zM8uOBdxxixjfC1olfRMTS1lClKkup0qtlrqqAihKzpMzlX30Td9NlfDloQtlrfxqNVUZsncBZ3ULeQr0OTrFJpiAk3uXScQsuKjT1yBpGP_DaI5St3I?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: Mephisto's base of operations / prison on Earth which quickly became a popular tourist attraction.<br>Notes: Frequently referred to as being on the Las Vegas strip. The exact position has floated around a bit, based on alternate artistic representations which feature different real-world Vegas casinos in the background. This placemark uses Rod Reis' original position from Doctor Strange: Damnation #1, which shows Bally's to the southeast and the Cosmopolitan to the southwest. This position is supported in the Damnation issues of  Iron Fist (78, 80).<br>]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
