          <Data name="Notes">
            <value><![CDATA[Frequently referred to as being on the Las Vegas strip. The exact position has floated around a bit, based on alternate artistic representations which feature different real-world Vegas casinos in the background. This placemark uses Rod Reis' original position from Doctor Strange: Damnation #1, which shows Bally's to the southeast and the Cosmopolitan to the southwest. This position is supported in the Damnation issues of  Iron Fist (78, 80).
]]></value>
