      <Placemark>
        <name>Kravinoff Estate</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7R-ZoRYeWQP3BNA6V-dxTRhyrb0xv6LWH3D8RFLflIoIhZWwtILPSHICpqBsTSGMcFkPgxN9BazhLqQTJwez3C32qarLaYuAa8FVY9tQpjUR_K1UsGWDH-RmVwuMK-UFM9awiqYMQFPLMVT7XcWSZ1O9wygeYxTHUz1xb5cERKbF8j6eBlA6npvKEt4skZZj0Syiw?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: Kraven the Hunter's family estate at which he buried Spider-Man alive before committing suicide himself.<br>Notes: In Kraven's Last Hunt, Kraven's inner monologue said that Spider-Man was buried 100 miles from New York. More recently, the 2010 Grim Hunt arc established that it was 15 miles. I'm going with the more recent distance that is closer to the city. Beyond that, this placemark is just placed on a remote fancy mansion]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value><![CDATA[Kraven the Hunter's family estate at which he buried Spider-Man alive before committing suicide himself.]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value><![CDATA[In Kraven's Last Hunt, Kraven's inner monologue said that Spider-Man was buried 100 miles from New York. More recently, the 2010 Grim Hunt arc established that it was 15 miles. I'm going with the more recent distance that is closer to the city. Beyond that, this placemark is just placed on a remote fancy mansion]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7R-ZoRYeWQP3BNA6V-dxTRhyrb0xv6LWH3D8RFLflIoIhZWwtILPSHICpqBsTSGMcFkPgxN9BazhLqQTJwez3C32qarLaYuAa8FVY9tQpjUR_K1UsGWDH-RmVwuMK-UFM9awiqYMQFPLMVT7XcWSZ1O9wygeYxTHUz1xb5cERKbF8j6eBlA6npvKEt4skZZj0Syiw?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
