        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>Autocratic nation ruled with an iron fist by Doctor Doom.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value>The first two editions of the Official Handbook positioned the triangular-shaped Latveria at the crossroads of Hungary, Romaina (Transylvanian region) and the Serbia (then part of Yugoslavia). The land boundary shown here uses actual borders of the Romanian county of Timiș.</value>
          </Data>
