      <Placemark>
        <name>Madripoor</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR5P-KhNbOMiORojG6-GEARAdbhP517JMeiGJpigFygCV5m-9eNTuuXS_xLCgPC57cW52XZc4Md2-nZO3VMQRjrHRtAZEw92RIEc-o40ASQdHtocQHHZzAlVdBYgSAAbkFJ99y_oN_8LmYpsVozyTbWWkFLGepMGyGtzpiQUSq5NCPFBRiRcS25e98pA6rrohWuzGh0?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: Island nation without extradition laws which has become a haven for an assortment of criminals from around the world<br>Notes: The size and location is an amalgamation of details from 2004's Official Handbook: Wolverine and 2007's Marvel Atlas: strategic location near major trade route with natural harbor; 0°N 105°E, located to the south of Singapore in the vicinity of Kepulauan Lingga in the Indonesian archipelago; 377 square miles. The harbor is taken from the Wolverine Handbook, but the rest of the island is invented to approximate the square milage and to fit in with the surrounding island formations.<br>]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>Island nation without extradition laws which has become a haven for an assortment of criminals from around the world</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value><![CDATA[The size and location is an amalgamation of details from 2004's Official Handbook: Wolverine and 2007's Marvel Atlas: strategic location near major trade route with natural harbor; 0°N 105°E, located to the south of Singapore in the vicinity of Kepulauan Lingga in the Indonesian archipelago; 377 square miles. The harbor is taken from the Wolverine Handbook, but the rest of the island is invented to approximate the square milage and to fit in with the surrounding island formations.
]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR5P-KhNbOMiORojG6-GEARAdbhP517JMeiGJpigFygCV5m-9eNTuuXS_xLCgPC57cW52XZc4Md2-nZO3VMQRjrHRtAZEw92RIEc-o40ASQdHtocQHHZzAlVdBYgSAAbkFJ99y_oN_8LmYpsVozyTbWWkFLGepMGyGtzpiQUSq5NCPFBRiRcS25e98pA6rrohWuzGh0?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
