      <Placemark>
        <name><![CDATA[Man-Thing's Swamp (The Nexus of All Realities)]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR5B9qa6mn2nnwDqUKtX8zDouTXpjAB9MtwYvAUPZF_EYeW6iS9e3D1yQQzqKBTxZFJu_xhNT_D7kUNofodhlllUsiljZh-lzLr8WvbTskhNB6FUP3oDeTPOwMbDD0-EY6q33yGOquC7gllUer9wgCxExaMFqbEuhuO2xng7YZ_L6JjvfU9O-36yvzy7ny_wzrPfk_E?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: Dimensional gateway to all realities and dimensions hidden within a secluded section of swampland that is home to the Man-Thing<br>Notes: The Official Handbook map places the swamp to the southwest of Lake Okeechobee. Moreover, Man-Thing #4 gives actual directions to nearby Citrusville: “It’s a two-hour drive from Miami to Citrusville, west along interstate 75 — “Alligator Alley” or, to be formal, the Everglades Parkway — to Route 29, then hang a right and head north into the swamp.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1769-FF5252-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>Dimensional gateway to all realities and dimensions hidden within a secluded section of swampland that is home to the Man-Thing</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value>The Official Handbook map places the swamp to the southwest of Lake Okeechobee. Moreover, Man-Thing #4 gives actual directions to nearby Citrusville: “It’s a two-hour drive from Miami to Citrusville, west along interstate 75 — “Alligator Alley” or, to be formal, the Everglades Parkway — to Route 29, then hang a right and head north into the swamp.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR5B9qa6mn2nnwDqUKtX8zDouTXpjAB9MtwYvAUPZF_EYeW6iS9e3D1yQQzqKBTxZFJu_xhNT_D7kUNofodhlllUsiljZh-lzLr8WvbTskhNB6FUP3oDeTPOwMbDD0-EY6q33yGOquC7gllUer9wgCxExaMFqbEuhuO2xng7YZ_L6JjvfU9O-36yvzy7ny_wzrPfk_E?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
