      <Placemark>
        <name><![CDATA[Night Nurse's Clinic]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR5IIWMw1bQ7E46IxXOOmd9GVYJhrtfkk0A4GwTHwu8qTpyfCrWy6VzCMEZif42mEasxiKgjKgDqasESCQUx5UQCz-yeW4Lj05CBEAv4Ibx1PfTcfjNmD4eRxTRsX1MBjGYZYqQIyz_yGfXyCYC3JX3USZ4u-JY1EoYFhPHjruOTUdfinVYe0gn2W9mBTCMY0JwD5UQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: The secret facility to provide medical assistance to New York super-heroes.<br>Notes: Accounts have placed the clinic on Orchard Street (Doctor Strange: The Oath #3, Jane Foster: Valkyrie #6) and in Chinatown (Daredevil #512). This street overlaps with this neighborhood for just over one block (between Hester and Division St). This placemark uses an older, nondescript brick building that has a roller shutter as shown in Valkyrie #6]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>The secret facility to provide medical assistance to New York super-heroes.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value>Accounts have placed the clinic on Orchard Street (Doctor Strange: The Oath #3, Jane Foster: Valkyrie #6) and in Chinatown (Daredevil #512). This street overlaps with this neighborhood for just over one block (between Hester and Division St). This placemark uses an older, nondescript brick building that has a roller shutter as shown in Valkyrie #6</value>
          </Data>
