      <Placemark>
        <name>Nova Roma</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7K81IvzU1sJMxY4R_oBNWdSYG-2ulWWEJiD9iFOGuGjav2aa7M03UkEWRuozSSQsv4dInhaHpRRbb_ii26jdiudndgg3KQPRutD5RGK6SOzvMZOkrLKYNbl1t1zUQY4Q2XO-3WM9s0Vc-sBxLxz2jShhNYCoZqFQIk6qFlKh-_XqRcpuQv0y0iLwJPu1M3FiXIAFs?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: An isolated community of refugees from ancient Rome whose culture remained unchanged, save for a slight Inca influence.<br>Notes: Although Nova Roma is traditionally regarded as being in Brazil, it cannot be. Although the New Mutants disembarked from Brazil up the Madeira River. But since the community is unambiguously portrayed as being secluded in the Andes Mountains — and the Andes don’t reach Brazil — it must instead be in Peru. Since it is also portrayed as having a river run by it, I chose a stretch of the Ene River removed from civilization and roads.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>An isolated community of refugees from ancient Rome whose culture remained unchanged, save for a slight Inca influence.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value>Although Nova Roma is traditionally regarded as being in Brazil, it cannot be. Although the New Mutants disembarked from Brazil up the Madeira River. But since the community is unambiguously portrayed as being secluded in the Andes Mountains — and the Andes don’t reach Brazil — it must instead be in Peru. Since it is also portrayed as having a river run by it, I chose a stretch of the Ene River removed from civilization and roads.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7K81IvzU1sJMxY4R_oBNWdSYG-2ulWWEJiD9iFOGuGjav2aa7M03UkEWRuozSSQsv4dInhaHpRRbb_ii26jdiudndgg3KQPRutD5RGK6SOzvMZOkrLKYNbl1t1zUQY4Q2XO-3WM9s0Vc-sBxLxz2jShhNYCoZqFQIk6qFlKh-_XqRcpuQv0y0iLwJPu1M3FiXIAFs?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            -74.1393471,-11.4418408,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
