        <name>The Parker House</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6wNMnBFP2LNn3LM3a8WJlCRXVQ8uQcZbu0GtJeL7DzRJphPzF728ZZCpB5vroqrhtJNPY3ZlA9PXP2ViuvkB7PcxnQKaZqCc185g7f5g8TufvDjUOhla1nt6Oe40COSFo9baORiE3pBKwmSyLctWjorH5KFhIEvDVes3oFTPLTd95nn5xrc9Hy49tU_jHIaTIYxKM?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: Peter Parker's boyhood home, in which he lived with his Uncle Ben and Aunt May<br>Notes: Although there has been at least one other address given for the residence (specifically, from Straczynski's Sins Past story), this placemark uses the more commonplace address of 20 Ingram Street first cited in Amazing Spider-Man #317.]]></description>
