      <Placemark>
        <name>Phoenix Rises</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6GcbKmRn-QgLegDDzhAAYkEb4SxNYuMzl6i6F_4wpeZcAovo_LxG_tV81Y7OEJ6do4V41J54IIBDaUKeLLBZ_ZGIdCUl7hICxVRP0VbTnGP539NPTq1_EA19wh18qp0OhRKKXiMYJmbnKp-aioBGEgPLiTQazw2-D20Tnf4cjqzAkKIqapchAWVbwfvQ3EDtR2nN4?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: The location where the Jean Grey-disguised Phoenix crash landed a space shuttle and emerged as the Phoenix. The real Jean Grey was discovered here years later<br>Notes: The flight path from X-Men #101 (Long Beach to Cedarhurst to JFK, smashing through the runway crash barrier) is a little suspect because that would send it into Queens rather than Jamaica Bay. Jean Grey’s recovery in Avengers #263 is much more straightforward: in Jamaica Bay nearby the intersection of two runways.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1769-FF5252-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>The location where the Jean Grey-disguised Phoenix crash landed a space shuttle and emerged as the Phoenix. The real Jean Grey was discovered here years later</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value>The flight path from X-Men #101 (Long Beach to Cedarhurst to JFK, smashing through the runway crash barrier) is a little suspect because that would send it into Queens rather than Jamaica Bay. Jean Grey’s recovery in Avengers #263 is much more straightforward: in Jamaica Bay nearby the intersection of two runways.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6GcbKmRn-QgLegDDzhAAYkEb4SxNYuMzl6i6F_4wpeZcAovo_LxG_tV81Y7OEJ6do4V41J54IIBDaUKeLLBZ_ZGIdCUl7hICxVRP0VbTnGP539NPTq1_EA19wh18qp0OhRKKXiMYJmbnKp-aioBGEgPLiTQazw2-D20Tnf4cjqzAkKIqapchAWVbwfvQ3EDtR2nN4?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            -73.7997867,40.6297654,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Project: PEGASUS</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7z1OzcE7MMWVJrmhE7L3GMB1iKAeL8RrU8_Q3RuEeG_ROvn3NMvmJvBPK1FTUy8Uc0E0Ez3Pa-I7uzptQtW_SJsnN1zKsjzDGKZTkuPElaM-jtb3Nr0yJQfglMnnKWvHv3B9u5YA3vR1e_Ej6AxOhg5iOH9IE_3WjpobAkYdlmLVZ2UH4fP3le7bxwewRPqD9Q0Vs?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: Hilltop government-operated research facility for alternative and exotic forms of energy; periodically used as a prison for superhumans<br>Notes: The original Handbook places the facility on the fictional Mount Athena in the Catskill Mountains. Beyond that, I just looked for remote, flat-topped hills.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>Hilltop government-operated research facility for alternative and exotic forms of energy; periodically used as a prison for superhumans</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value>The original Handbook places the facility on the fictional Mount Athena in the Catskill Mountains. Beyond that, I just looked for remote, flat-topped hills.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7z1OzcE7MMWVJrmhE7L3GMB1iKAeL8RrU8_Q3RuEeG_ROvn3NMvmJvBPK1FTUy8Uc0E0Ez3Pa-I7uzptQtW_SJsnN1zKsjzDGKZTkuPElaM-jtb3Nr0yJQfglMnnKWvHv3B9u5YA3vR1e_Ej6AxOhg5iOH9IE_3WjpobAkYdlmLVZ2UH4fP3le7bxwewRPqD9Q0Vs?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
