        <name><![CDATA[Runaways' Hostel]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7JRB-GWvpU4PF_5j0eWRYb7p5k3x8wN1ZwLd3M8_6irxoNBs87zy1GjOShEKNNJ4p_Cae0lY3bdDGvqVkLLbUj_plymKJNuM4K0j3njwsmgG75r-Ae0_-4R28bcaA5CKjn-Pgq4A5wqNY04uO4mdCXQ1-J_NhRol6BazhOqXNRhMDvSbRIj_88rkZ242ljgcuCbLg?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: A forgotten, semi-buried mansion from the 20s that serves as the Runaways’ hideout.<br>Notes: The comics place the Hostel in Bronson Canyon and Chase mentions they are further away from Franklin Avenue than where the Batman TV series cave was filmed. Mentioned to be "off the beaten track," but still accessible to vehicles. ]]></description>
