        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR4oRgVjdpxvFIbLqZiDN_RfyAzJIHBWt39dJk64JHkwFkg4lsIHzis1NODzPTZOvUrXVa0NId2MEHs4tbgMMfsoRr-ouE6vSfWGYhrmue1P8B-b4djvE7AJEuoT0TEugmXXKi8TyE1gIfYHdk1bm1reQ3UFfduKGSSjE_l3_-CFNhfz0HnCMgJPMrqxWGqM9lgPSUs?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: Original headquarters of Tony Stark's engineering and manufacturing enterprise before being taken over by Obadiah Stane.<br>Notes: Tales of Suspense #45 indicated that his Flushing site was near Shea Stadium and the World’s Fair Flushing Meadows grounds. The Official Handbook placed Stark International at the edge of Long Island Sound (of which Flushing Bay is a part of).<br>]]></description>
