        <name>Strange Academy</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7NJ0XiQQuh-1hHp9SGsJdUmYo78IQPev0fC0Uu8jgJ6NNA0RoDwiCCDWkGMcWOlHa8xg627mYlpX2PMVInjZ9lLKh3O3GBBwxdtDAmcje86hJCodfLMjAZmyL9OxdanJJmVVAFfkR9o2F_Sb4TMX9pvKMlK5iGKmOQLeqlpJhb7n_vYqZT4AZiMp8PGCdA_P2QC8Q?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: The mystically-displaced school to help young people with magical potential control their powers.<br>Notes: Strange Academy #1 portrays the entrance to the grounds being a short walk from Bourbon Street. Strange Academy #3 cites Jackson Park as the setting for a class the Ancient One is conducting. Directly afterwards, the students are shown leaving the grounds to go to the French Quarter.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1769-FF5252-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>The mystically-displaced school to help young people with magical potential control their powers.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value>Strange Academy #1 portrays the entrance to the grounds being a short walk from Bourbon Street. Strange Academy #3 cites Jackson Park as the setting for a class the Ancient One is conducting. Directly afterwards, the students are shown leaving the grounds to go to the French Quarter.</value>
