      <Placemark>
        <name>Symkaria</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR5RtbrrwL1CbPZkdoL6hW2ddnGhdbKTHqVPdEsMVRa10UCvHfvW41v2zJW8s-dg_OnDC8qNRT39oLSfmeZLGTA-u6Atqa-L52wmUcr6DPfApciTpkebaRwZhSIC2VmW80WOeAuQu73IyeDpuncuVTQM2xpItYwMD_Ub8VDhKlTh3MnJ2gZ3rxU8Ic8mBbOnrjUAGlo?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: European nation home to Silver Sable and her Wild Pack mercenary team.<br>Notes: Symkaria is defined by it’s shared border with Latveria. While the map from Secret Avengers #19 is excellent, it pushes a vaguely-defined Transia from the Carpathian Mountains. Instead, this land boundary shown here uses actual borders of the Romanian county of Caraș-Severin.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>European nation home to Silver Sable and her Wild Pack mercenary team.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value>Symkaria is defined by it’s shared border with Latveria. While the map from Secret Avengers #19 is excellent, it pushes a vaguely-defined Transia from the Carpathian Mountains. Instead, this land boundary shown here uses actual borders of the Romanian county of Caraș-Severin.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR5RtbrrwL1CbPZkdoL6hW2ddnGhdbKTHqVPdEsMVRa10UCvHfvW41v2zJW8s-dg_OnDC8qNRT39oLSfmeZLGTA-u6Atqa-L52wmUcr6DPfApciTpkebaRwZhSIC2VmW80WOeAuQu73IyeDpuncuVTQM2xpItYwMD_Ub8VDhKlTh3MnJ2gZ3rxU8Ic8mBbOnrjUAGlo?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
