      <Placemark>
        <name>Tabula Rasa</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR4eYtVR_H6yLRMjTU9De_Y3MdVIgerKSNECw692inWRCeqOr2VgCGif25Zp8e2nY0bIJleY5XyxN9JL8Xp03Xj0_I1CNY_OdLWHV2YdzmzTPZbzVikN_7ZFZ4RGyh6FZIgF4G2GQSqMCBrcYrWTXsiOQlXYZBgpUExXxC2Z2pQrOoCAFLVSlRVRjQbAgZ0820jUPwI?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: A unique, artificially-evolved ecosystem ten-miles in diameter that wiped out the small town of Tucker Creek, Montana that used to stand there.<br>Notes: Tabula Rasa was built on the remains of a town said to be Beaver Lake, but the real-world Beaver Lake really doesn't resemble the flat landscape portrayed in the comics. I suspect the creators wanted an iconic Montana big-sky landscape so I simply selected a flat, low-population area that does.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>A unique, artificially-evolved ecosystem ten-miles in diameter that wiped out the small town of Tucker Creek, Montana that used to stand there.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value><![CDATA[Tabula Rasa was built on the remains of a town said to be Beaver Lake, but the real-world Beaver Lake really doesn't resemble the flat landscape portrayed in the comics. I suspect the creators wanted an iconic Montana big-sky landscape so I simply selected a flat, low-population area that does.]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR4eYtVR_H6yLRMjTU9De_Y3MdVIgerKSNECw692inWRCeqOr2VgCGif25Zp8e2nY0bIJleY5XyxN9JL8Xp03Xj0_I1CNY_OdLWHV2YdzmzTPZbzVikN_7ZFZ4RGyh6FZIgF4G2GQSqMCBrcYrWTXsiOQlXYZBgpUExXxC2Z2pQrOoCAFLVSlRVRjQbAgZ0820jUPwI?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            -106.4991661,46.9753502,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Temple of Cyttorak</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6ggayist3g0WDmjonCl-3iS5uQ5I5Ro8z7iwcbKHt66aZnjBg9aXi1YPpDZtXCKNKhoBhjr-_go7yvWKhWZoR3eMPZsOzadTjYkZqnjMlS1ujPlaMy_JzyUe09dEz4MZbN__qL2QWWYvklaLf32_LPztjuaqYpnzuVjXBgkyeU5vKYkOtZMAWPAf4vC8Bl7kxCrFE?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: The shrine that contains the Crimson Gem of Cyttorak, which bestows the power of the Juggernaut<br>Notes: Amazing X-Men #15 shows the temple is in a remote, overgrown, hilly area near the coast somewhere in southeast Asia. Thor #1 and X-Men Black: Juggernaut both indicate the location is in Thailand. That narrows it down a lot because the vast majority of Thailand coastline is developed and populated. One of the very few areas that fit all the characteristics shown to date are the islands of the Mu Ko Surin National Park.<br>]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>The shrine that contains the Crimson Gem of Cyttorak, which bestows the power of the Juggernaut</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value>Amazing X-Men #15 shows the temple is in a remote, overgrown, hilly area near the coast somewhere in southeast Asia. Thor #1 and X-Men Black: Juggernaut both indicate the location is in Thailand. That narrows it down a lot because the vast majority of Thailand coastline is developed and populated. One of the very few areas that fit all the characteristics shown to date are the islands of the Mu Ko Surin National Park.
</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6ggayist3g0WDmjonCl-3iS5uQ5I5Ro8z7iwcbKHt66aZnjBg9aXi1YPpDZtXCKNKhoBhjr-_go7yvWKhWZoR3eMPZsOzadTjYkZqnjMlS1ujPlaMy_JzyUe09dEz4MZbN__qL2QWWYvklaLf32_LPztjuaqYpnzuVjXBgkyeU5vKYkOtZMAWPAf4vC8Bl7kxCrFE?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            97.8884611,9.4518224,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name><![CDATA[Thor's Cave]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7d0wvlTbefF63q9S_H2-6HViEodk2xQliaHVcarwIIGF9pom-dovN5lIe3kK2Of6893O8rQFN1UwpZvhV4wtK2pAbHJrNOoAW_MOi_FBHtqbBClsroEp8wfX7jl-MSorXNszjEYNPeZLN_FlEdsDDc4WzMwlgpY2v8rLcaotxVCE4P7pkpC5GOdQH-H_JwWXx6Ors?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: The cave in which Thor, in his false identity of Donald Blake, discovered Mjolnir during a trip to Norway. Moreover, according to Thor Annual #11, this is the same place as Thor's birth to Gaea ages prior.<br>Notes: A map in the original edition Official Handbook placed this location in this general region. Beyond that, I couldn't resist placing it near a village named Torheim, which translates to "home of Thor."]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value><![CDATA[The cave in which Thor, in his false identity of Donald Blake, discovered Mjolnir during a trip to Norway. Moreover, according to Thor Annual #11, this is the same place as Thor's birth to Gaea ages prior.]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value><![CDATA[A map in the original edition Official Handbook placed this location in this general region. Beyond that, I couldn't resist placing it near a village named Torheim, which translates to "home of Thor."]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7d0wvlTbefF63q9S_H2-6HViEodk2xQliaHVcarwIIGF9pom-dovN5lIe3kK2Of6893O8rQFN1UwpZvhV4wtK2pAbHJrNOoAW_MOi_FBHtqbBClsroEp8wfX7jl-MSorXNszjEYNPeZLN_FlEdsDDc4WzMwlgpY2v8rLcaotxVCE4P7pkpC5GOdQH-H_JwWXx6Ors?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
