      <Placemark>
        <name>Thunderbolts Mountain</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6pUS_oNANljpwBJJTwnrCfMtyCBuRGjkfNUHuOMiBJ7cX7a06F-xw_RaqLeBP12u1n1CQFETj1LjuFMd8QZPqerVeXNmFduMlUyQ2DrgBHg1HasMEbUirvIIz4HspENI2gMaVsDbH9eFuyNQHz-6OlBOq4i_0c88yhmpibMxsOrUf0Anq8WZqRrFoH19CRniz4FXk?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: The headquarters for various incarnations of Thunderbolts, Masters of Evil, Redeemers, and HAMMER<br>Notes: In Avengers #20 (2010), Hawkeye reveals his former Thunderbolts HQ (Mount Charteris, near Burton Canyon) is the same location as the Osborn-era Thunderbolts’ HQ (Thunderbolts Mountain, near Coyote Springs). Both are fictional towns, but it did narrow the search for peaks that are adjacent to two towns. Moreover, a character catches a flight to Denver International Airport — suggesting its closer to that city than other Colorado cities along the front range.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>The headquarters for various incarnations of Thunderbolts, Masters of Evil, Redeemers, and HAMMER</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value>In Avengers #20 (2010), Hawkeye reveals his former Thunderbolts HQ (Mount Charteris, near Burton Canyon) is the same location as the Osborn-era Thunderbolts’ HQ (Thunderbolts Mountain, near Coyote Springs). Both are fictional towns, but it did narrow the search for peaks that are adjacent to two towns. Moreover, a character catches a flight to Denver International Airport — suggesting its closer to that city than other Colorado cities along the front range.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6pUS_oNANljpwBJJTwnrCfMtyCBuRGjkfNUHuOMiBJ7cX7a06F-xw_RaqLeBP12u1n1CQFETj1LjuFMd8QZPqerVeXNmFduMlUyQ2DrgBHg1HasMEbUirvIIz4HspENI2gMaVsDbH9eFuyNQHz-6OlBOq4i_0c88yhmpibMxsOrUf0Anq8WZqRrFoH19CRniz4FXk?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            -106.1415948,39.6172095,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
