      <Placemark>
        <name>Transia</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR44Fg5AYCdKhB6TrWKxuapBEF0e1kDZYUlDRBH608YPm4kPFkihv7lGl2DjI1qlfvH18AuwzM4C297tHS43FpPup1oAOzxXbhPRhSP_zv3-tXHQqNQsQGKsnoVznkB0u1flI7oePB4WRvwLuxuHZ_3R9775K9DtH-Lr_EKtVij9CzO189F4X-p1UR7n6M1druvUSAQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: Tiny mountainous country defined by its enigmatic Mount Wundagore<br>Notes: This placement strives to maintain the general position shown in the Marvel Handbook Deluxe edition, keeping the tiny mountainous country nestled within the Carpathian Mountain range, carved out of the Romanian country of Mehedinți.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1594-757575-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>Tiny mountainous country defined by its enigmatic Mount Wundagore</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value>This placement strives to maintain the general position shown in the Marvel Handbook Deluxe edition, keeping the tiny mountainous country nestled within the Carpathian Mountain range, carved out of the Romanian country of Mehedinți.</value>
          </Data>
