      <Placemark>
        <name>Utopia</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR504obhmRZJ8lA8re4xPAofQHKVQmxo_EL8HbWXnbOJ9Qr6FJxP4hCJM-_zGJx8i6AJS_cHPB5h4Vve4R7Ov5ewf0gFtOgaPQkGP_bwWaLlmbc2SP28cyt76YSkwa_T8WvTJUO-h2cKLyDPPgL46BARKOgTx6-dmuYmMbqsYtFlM1U8VCRF5XdB1y_oPTyTlqOYCXc?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Description: Former island nation refuge for mutants under the leadership of Scott Summers. It also supported a sanctuary for Atlanteans underwater.<br>Notes: Though the comics occasionally said that Utopia lies within the San Francisco Bay, the story makes clear that it lies 1.2 miles off the San Francisco coastline. This specific location reflects its position from the Marvel Atlas.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1769-FF5252-labelson</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Description">
            <value>Former island nation refuge for mutants under the leadership of Scott Summers. It also supported a sanctuary for Atlanteans underwater.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Notes">
            <value>Though the comics occasionally said that Utopia lies within the San Francisco Bay, the story makes clear that it lies 1.2 miles off the San Francisco coastline. This specific location reflects its position from the Marvel Atlas.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR504obhmRZJ8lA8re4xPAofQHKVQmxo_EL8HbWXnbOJ9Qr6FJxP4hCJM-_zGJx8i6AJS_cHPB5h4Vve4R7Ov5ewf0gFtOgaPQkGP_bwWaLlmbc2SP28cyt76YSkwa_T8WvTJUO-h2cKLyDPPgL46BARKOgTx6-dmuYmMbqsYtFlM1U8VCRF5XdB1y_oPTyTlqOYCXc?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
